        "description": "Across retail, travel, food and more, some companies are charging consumers different prices for the same products and services. Lindsay Owens, author of the new book \u201cGouged: The End of a Fair Price and What That Menas for Your Wallet,\u201d says companies overcharge by using \u201cprice experiments\u201d where they change randomly between customers and some also use \u201csurveillance or personalized pricing\u201d where they charge prices based on your data all to increase profits. NBC\u2019s Vicky Nguyen rep",
